<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#172554] via-[#1e3a8a] to-[#075985] py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="relative mx-auto grid max-w-[1100px] gap-12 px-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.35fr_0.65fr] lg:items-center">
    <div>
      <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sky-200">
        Data Science · AI Agents · Process Systems
      </p>
      <h1 class="mb-5 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-white md:text-5xl">
        Building practical AI and machine-learning systems for industrial data.
      </h1>
      <p class="mb-3 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-blue-50">
        I’m Mustafa Alnagdy, combining process-engineering domain knowledge with Python,
        LangGraph, FastAPI, Supabase, and modern data workflows.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-8 text-sm text-sky-100">Based in Qalyubia, Egypt · Open to data science and ML opportunities</p>

      <div class="mb-6 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap">
