          width="1200"
          height="1600"
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
          class="h-24 w-20 rounded-lg object-cover"
        />
        <div>
          <p class="font-semibold">Mustafa Alnagdy</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-blue-100">Data science and AI with a process-systems perspective.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mb-5 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-sky-200">Current focus</p>
      <ul class="space-y-5">
        <li>
          <p class="font-semibold">Production-minded AI agents</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-blue-100">Structured outputs, validation, retrieval, and observable workflows.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="border-t border-white/15 pt-5">
          <p class="font-semibold">Industrial machine learning</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-blue-100">Sensor data, anomaly detection, forecasting, and process optimization.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="border-t border-white/15 pt-5">
          <p class="font-semibold">End-to-end delivery</p>
